        | 0x800A0000    | 0x8FFFFFFF  | Reserved 255 MB              | &#10060;        |
        | 0x80090000    | 0x8009FFFF  | USB 2.0 OTG registers 64 KB  | &#10060;        |
        | 0x80080000    | 0x8008FFFF  | SIO0 registers 64 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x80000000    | 0x8007FFFF  | Reserved 512 KB              | &#10060;        |
        | 0x36000000    | 0x7FFFFFFF  | Reserved 1183 MB             | &#10060;        |
        | 0x34000000    | 0x35FFFFFF  | SMI CS0 32 MB          | &#10060;        |
        | 0x32000000    | 0x33FFFFFF  | Reserved 32 MB               | &#10060;        |
