        | 0x2C000000    | 0x2FFFFFFF  | Reserved 64 MB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x28000000    | 0x2BFFFFFF  | Reserved 64 MB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x24000000    | 0x27FFFFFF  | Reserved 64 MB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x101FE000    | 0x23FFFFFF  | Reserved 318 MB              | &#10060;        |
