        | 0x101F3000    | 0x101F3FFF  | UART2 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x101F2000    | 0x101F2FFF  | UART1 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
        | 0x101F1000    | 0x101F1FFF  | UART0 registers 4 KB         | &#9989;         |
