        | 0x10140000    | 0x1014FFFF  | INT registers 64 KB          | &#9989;         |
        | 0x10130000    | 0x1013FFFF  | DMA registers 64 KB          | &#9989;         |
        | 0x10120000    | 0x1012FFFF  | Reserved 64 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x10110000    | 0x1011FFFF  | Reserved 64 KB               | &#10060;        |
        | 0x10100000    | 0x1010FFFF  | SMI registers 64 KB          | &#9989;         |
